{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T01:10:10.503Z","ordinal":68984,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0f4fd85789ec756b016b039269c6a487d287cd24cba560a7ad","status":"completed","call_id":"call_72afa7d34f524e4eb1d392a50647d752","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/context-maturity-v130/docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md\\n@@\\n-| Compounding value | 1 — Ad hoc in the no-memory test fixture; 2 — Exploratory only when durable knowledge, notes, or compaction links are observed | Session state, notes, compaction predecessor IDs, and workspace knowledge can be inventoried without copying their text into the inventory. Unverified memory remains labeled unverified. | No reviewed provenance-preserving durable-memory promotion, per-scope deletion/expiry enforcement, or held-out quality evidence. |\\n+| Compounding value | 1 — Ad hoc in the no-memory test fixture; 2 — Exploratory only when durable knowledge, notes, or compaction links are observed | Session state and workspace knowledge are inventoried without copying their text. Operator-created repository memory carries provenance, validation state, timestamps and retention; legacy entries are explicitly unverified; prompt memory is labeled non-evidence; model writes and automatic conversation extraction are disabled. | No held-out quality evidence demonstrates that accumulated memory improves task outcomes. User/profile durable memory and per-scope retention remain outside the existing project knowledge model. |\\n@@\\n-| Compounding value | 1 — Ad hoc in the no-memory test fixture; 2 — Exploratory only when durable knowledge, notes, or compaction links are observed | Session state, notes, compaction predecessor IDs, and workspace knowledge can be inventoried without copying their text into the inventory. Unverified memory remains labeled unverified. | No reviewed provenance-preserving durable-memory promotion, per-scope deletion/expiry enforcement, or held-out quality evidence. |\\n+| Compounding value | 1 — Ad hoc in the no-memory test fixture; 2 — Exploratory only when durable knowledge, notes, or compaction links are observed | Session state and workspace knowledge are inventoried without copying their text. Operator-only promotion preserves provenance, unverified validation state, repository scope and retention; legacy entries migrate as unverified; expiry is enforced; model writes and automatic extraction are disabled. | No held-out evidence shows persistent memory improves engineering outcomes; the existing store has repository scope only. |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a205e5-07d1-72b3-b0a4-db59d82d43bb","create_time":1795396201.7823179}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":30518,"sampled_through_sequence":30516,"client_authored":false}}
