 Pipeline\",\"description\":\"Create a spreadsheet using the Sales Pipeline template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Sales Pipeline. Track opportunities, stages, owners, deal sizes, probabilities, forecasts, next steps, and risks.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc148191b504023513d219ca\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-sales-pipeline\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-simple-dark-mode\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-simple-dark-mode\",\"title\":\"Simple Dark Mode\",\"description\":\"Create a presentation using the Simple Dark Mode template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Simple Dark Mode. Create clean dark-mode presentations with bold typography, simple sections, charts, and imagery.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc188191ac80335d6d2609f2\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-simple-dark-mode\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-simple-light-mode\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-simple-light-mode\",\"title\":\"Simple Light Mode\",\"description\":\"Create a presentation using the Simple Light Mode template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Simple Light Mode. Create clean light-mode presentations with spacious typography, simple sections, charts, and imagery.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc1c81918b1d571866753f69\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-simple-light-mode\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-strategy-memorandum\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-strategy-memorandum\",\"title\":\"Strategy Memorandum\",\"description\":\"Create a document using the Strategy Memorandum template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Strategy Memorandum. Present strategic context, choices, rationale, risks, milestones, and a clear recommendation.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc208191b851e518f7d802bb\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-strategy-memorandum\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-system-design\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-system-design\",\"title\":\"System Design\",\"description\":\"Create a document using the System Design template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names System Design. Document system architecture, requirements, components, data flows, APIs, tradeoffs, and operational considerations.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc2481918c654b7fa5b8a772\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-system-design\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-team-alignment\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-team-alignment\",\"title\":\"Team Alignment\",\"description\":\"Create a presentation using the Team Alignment template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Team Alignment. Facilitate team offsites and planning with context, goals, priorities, decisions, and action items.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc288191a9c1edc952010f81\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-team-alignment\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f/artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"title\":\"Three-Statement Forecast\",\"description\":\"Create a spreadsheet using the Three-Statement Forecast template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Three-Statement Forecast. Build an integrated income statement, balance sheet, and cash flow forecast with assumptions, checks, and an executive summary.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_2330815c823c8191941e5dc465bb899f\",\"plugin_name\":\"openai-templates\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a6ced4ebc8c8191bf7c17972c03db1c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a6ced4fdc2c8191ab4516ba7697f480\",\"skill_name\":\"artifact-template-three-statement-forecast\",\"contents\":[\"assets\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":false}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/maintain-space\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/maintain-space\",\"title\":\"Maintain page content\",\"description\":\"Reconcile new evidence into existing ChatGPT Pages or a Space when the user requests upkeep. For a direct text correction, use write-page. Do not use for ordinary chat drafts, writing, or advice, or treat a selected Page as a request to save. Schedule future upkeep only when requested.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c\",\"plugin_name\":\"pages\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6ab68a367fcc8191ad5a130fa1d93a6c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_104170f7511c8191b7df56f8802ea4d5\",\"skill_name\":\"maintain-space\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/manage-schedules\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/manage-schedules\",\"title\":\"Manage schedules for this page\",\"description\":\"Review a ChatGPT Space page and its schedules, recommend useful recurring work, and create, update, or remove scheduled automations.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c\",\"plugin_name\":\"pages\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6ab68a367fcc8191ad5a130fa1d93a6c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_4dba0cd90350819192783a844d8c1a87\",\"skill_name\":\"manage-schedules\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/organize-space\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/organize-space\",\"title\":\"Organize pages\",\"description\":\"Organize existing ChatGPT Pages and Space structure when the user requests changes to that structure. Do not use for ordinary chat drafts or advice; a selected Page alone does not authorize reorganization. A narrow text edit does not need this workflow.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c\",\"plugin_name\":\"pages\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6ab68a367fcc8191ad5a130fa1d93a6c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_a360f8e994508191b71da65db46f23ad\",\"skill_name\":\"organize-space\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/write-page\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c/write-page\",\"title\":\"Write and edit a page\",\"description\":\"Create or edit requested Page/Space content, or use for prose you have already decided to save as a standalone Markdown file, only if the user did not explicitly request a Markdown file. Honor established formats, destinations, and repository documentation. A selected Page alone does not authorize a write.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_4a72ddeef4c481918f92d8e8df18fb2c\",\"plugin_name\":\"pages\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6ab68a367fcc8191ad5a130fa1d93a6c\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_2247832b32088191a6f73b5984466667\",\"skill_name\":\"write-page\",\"contents\":[\"references\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/create-pet\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/create-pet\",\"title\":\"Create pet\",\"description\":\"Create, repair, validate, preview, upload, or activate an animated v2 pet in ChatGPT Work mode from a character idea, brand cue, or reference image. Use for new ChatGPT Pets, custom mascots, non-pixel styles, and unattached sprite sheets requiring nine animation states plus sixteen look directions. Preserve Library artifacts and Pets MCP lifecycle behavior. Exclude real pets, standalone images, and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573a53888191b6f2c38c1a8ad4ca\",\"skill_name\":\"create-pet\",\"contents\":[\"references\",\"scripts\"],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/pets\",\"title\":\"Pets\",\"description\":\"List, inspect, select, download, or delete animated pets in ChatGPT Work mode. Use for an explicit pet in ChatGPT or established ChatGPT Pets context. Exclude real-world and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573ba8bc819186e79bd4858c707b\",\"skill_name\":\"pets\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/update-pet\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa/update-pet\",\"title\":\"Update pet\",\"description\":\"Inspect, validate, preview, repair, or update a custom pet in ChatGPT Work mode, including its name, description, or sprite sheet. Use for a pet in ChatGPT or established ChatGPT Pets context. Exclude real-world and other-app pets; clarify before invoking.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_bccf6c8660c08191ae4470d9ae4877fa\",\"plugin_name\":\"work-pets\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a605738d6308191b431b6477919eafb\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a60573d52608191b967e6759086094c\",\"skill_name\":\"update-pet\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_b3438d6beb9081918fba3625bc988128/plugin-management\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_b3438d6beb9081918fba3625bc988128/plugin-management\",\"title\":\"plugin-management\",\"description\":\"Discover and suggest relevant plugins, inspect app permissions and dependencies, and manage plugin connections or removal. Use when the user asks about plugins or when a task would materially benefit from an external app, account, service, or data source that available tools cannot access.\",\"mimeType\":\"mcp/skill\",\"_meta\":{\"plugin_id\":\"plugin_connector_1p_b3438d6beb9081918fba3625bc988128\",\"plugin_name\":\"plugin-management\",\"plugin_release_id\":\"pluginrel_6a7e9f7d0ef08191b97b213bb9e118ef\",\"plugin_release_skill_id\":\"pluginrsk_6a7e9f7d68608191bca9945146cbe6f1\",\"skill_name\":\"plugin-management\",\"contents\":[],\"allow_implicit_invocation\":true}},{\"server\":\"codex_apps\",\"uri\":\"skill://plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites\",\"name\":\"plugin_connector_1p_689987207de08191979cf68eca2941c6/sites\",\"title\":\"sites\",\"description\":\"Use Sites when the user wants a website built for them (including a landing page, portfolio, dashboard, portal, tracker, hub, game, event registration, or tool), requests changes to a website already built with Sites, wants to publish a website with Sites, or wants to manage Sites hosting.\",\"mimeT