ed yet (144.365414ms)\n✔ slash router: session commands (2493.751111ms)\n▶ slash router: workspace commands\n  ✔ diff reports a clean tree, then the change as a diff (376.687459ms)\n  ✔ git shows the short status (295.480166ms)\n  ✔ stage lists hunks and reset unstages (446.14695ms)\n  ✔ commit suggests a message into the composer, then commits (353.070707ms)\n  ✔ checkpoint, checkpoints, checkpoint diff and undo (508.856298ms)\n  ✔ worktree and audit describe an empty state (132.632022ms)\n  ✔ worktree runs the named-worktree commands and keeps the legacy forms (2601.429584ms)\n  ✔ worktree merge with a target reaches the named merge; a bare merge stays the speculative one (2307.595216ms)\n  ✔ worktree merge --ai-message with an already-aborted command signal merges nothing (915.900991ms)\n  ✔ an agent that started inside a worktree can be moved out of it after the worktree is merged away, with its durable state still valid (1915.083166ms)\n  ✔ git commands outside a repository say so (310.321774ms)\n  ✔ copy needs a reply; paste fills the composer or reports the clipboard error (143.035179ms)\n  ✔ paste refuses a clipboard too large for one protocol line (123.211614ms)\n✔ slash router: workspace commands (10432.239468ms)\n▶ slash router: extensions and turns\n  ✔ plan adds, starts, completes and clears phases (121.032522ms)\n  ✔ knowledge sets, lists and deletes entries (162.74181ms)\n  ✔ skills, skill lookup and skill scaffolding (168.103757ms)\n  ✔ image validates its file and resolves to a vision turn (128.40059ms)\n  ✔ commands that need arguments explain their usage (162.55903ms)\n  ✔ mcp and plugins describe what is configured (139.942199ms)\n\n🔴 === TDD PHASE 1: RED (Create Reproduction Test) ===\n\n  ✔ ! runs a shell command directly and !<n> reruns a prompt (376.195533ms)\n  ✔ a cancelled TDD cycle stops after the running phase (176.968059ms)\n  ✔ every REPL slash command has a TUI counterpart (2.45443ms)\n  ✔ every catalogue command has a handler (0.3777