{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T02:00:07.730Z","ordinal":70854,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0f4fd85789ec756b016b039e214a5887d2a04a3f52d9ef0f97","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ae163436d479409dbe76067ed7e0eaa7","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/context-maturity-v130/docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md\\n@@\\n-- `InferenceContextManifest`: bounded latest-24 session records created immediately before `submitGuardingLength` calls the adapter. It stores message position/role references, effective tool-schema positions/counts, client token estimate, context/output budgets and their sources, optional admission measurement, and dispatch outcome. Prompt and schema text, raw request IDs, model/provider identity, and content hashes are not persisted.\\n+- `InferenceContextManifest`: bounded latest-24 session records created immediately before `submitGuardingLength` calls the adapter. It stores message position/role references, effective tool-schema positions/counts, client token estimate, context/output budgets and their sources, and dispatch outcome. Provider token-count observations remain in the existing separate token-accounting record because the code does not bind every such measurement to the exact same serialized arrays. Prompt and schema text, raw request IDs, model/provider identity, and content hashes are not persisted.\\n@@\\n-9. A request manifest is durably written before adapter dispatch where the existing durable sinks are available, receives `response_received` only after the adapter returns, and is reconciled to `unknown_effect` after failure or restart before response persistence.\\n+9. A request manifest is durably written before adapter dispatch when a configured sink exists; a configured durable-write failure prevents that request from being sent. It receives `response_received` only after the adapter returns and is reconciled to `unknown_effect` after failure or restart before response persistence.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a20602-56e4-7401-a61d-85bcc9f8019b","create_time":1795399201.2928598}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":31354,"sampled_through_sequence":31352,"client_authored":false}}
