{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T02:06:49.133Z","ordinal":71060,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0f4fd85789ec756b016b039fb528b087d29dcb684bcf2d251a","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ab1b5a68cce946f3b491d734005b748f","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/context-maturity-v130/docs/research/context-engineering/CONTEXT-MATURITY-SYSTEM.md\\n@@\\n-| Retrieval speed | 2 — Exploratory | Inspection reports per-source and total local collection timings; outgoing request manifests report client-estimated tokens, configured/advertised limits, and separate token-admission source when available. | No per-source deadline, request-preparation latency distribution, cache telemetry, or retrieval SLO. Do not interpret inventory collection timing as inference latency. |\\n+| Retrieval speed | 2 — Exploratory | Inspection reports per-source and total local collection timings; request manifests report client-estimated tokens and configured/advertised limits. The existing `/context inspect` output reports its last request count/source separately when available. | No per-source deadline, request-preparation latency distribution, cache telemetry, or retrieval SLO. Do not interpret inventory collection timing as inference latency. |\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a20602-56e4-7401-a61d-85bcc9f8019b","create_time":1795399605.1611745}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":31445,"sampled_through_sequence":31443,"client_authored":false}}
